sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant Tool as PITCH UI
participant LTIGW as LTI Gateway
participant GC as GradeController
participant GS as GradeService
participant LMS as LMS

Tool->>LTIGW: Submit Grade Update (Score, User)
LTIGW->>GC: Forward Grade Request
GC->>GS: Validate + Process Grade Update
GS->>LMS: Send Grade via AGS Endpoint
LMS-->>GS: Acknowledge Grade
GS-->>GC: Success Response
GC-->>LTIGW: Grade Synced
LTIGW-->>Tool: Show Confirmation
